{"3686990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "亡犬 Dead Dog", "steam_appid": 3686990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Dog</strong> is a pixel-art stealth Metroidvania that blends action, exploration, and tactical infiltration. You play as a canine samurai returning for revenge, slipping through a world of light and shadow using abilities like <strong>Shadow Clone</strong> and <strong>Shadow Blink</strong> to outwit enemies, solve puzzles, and survive deadly encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔸A City Built on Light and Shadow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner hides danger—or opportunity. Sneak past patrols, manipulate light sources, and use environmental sounds to lure enemies away. Choose between silent infiltration or stylish combat. Your playstyle defines your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔸Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕶️ Dynamic Stealth Mechanics</strong><br>Light defines visibility. Enemies can only see illuminated areas. Hide in shadows, crouch behind cover, disable lights, or distract guards with sound and trickery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌑 Shadow Clone &amp; Blink Abilities</strong><br>Unlock powerful skills to navigate complex traps and outmaneuver enemies. Send your clone into danger or blink behind enemies before they even notice you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ Metroidvania Exploration</strong><br>Non-linear maps with ability-gated progression. Unlock shortcuts, discover hidden paths, and dive into secret challenge rooms filled with risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐺 Strategic Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses with distinct mechanics—some lurk in darkness, others summon illusions or use deadly traps. Each encounter is a battle of wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Handcrafted Pixel Art &amp; Animation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted world by veteran pixel artists, where delicate performance animations breathe life into the characters, presenting a unique Eastern dog-knight aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/ba6e7046395814f927a4a22bdafabf6c.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/ba6e7046395814f927a4a22bdafabf6c.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/ba6e7046395814f927a4a22bdafabf6c.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>📖 Immersive Animal Fable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/79c2330f15a124ca5dcc99ba7d0dd8ba.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1526 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beastly society echoing human flaws, filled with symbolism and poetic tragedy. Piece together the hero’s mysterious past and uncover a story of revenge, loss, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/256f3fc13515cce7a1e3fbefcb3c8ac0.avif?t=1786505092\" width=890 height=910 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Dog</strong> is a pixel-art stealth Metroidvania that blends action, exploration, and tactical infiltration. You play as a canine samurai returning for revenge, slipping through a world of light and shadow using abilities like <strong>Shadow Clone</strong> and <strong>Shadow Blink</strong> to outwit enemies, solve puzzles, and survive deadly encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔸A City Built on Light and Shadow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner hides danger—or opportunity. Sneak past patrols, manipulate light sources, and use environmental sounds to lure enemies away. Choose between silent infiltration or stylish combat. Your playstyle defines your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔸Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕶️ Dynamic Stealth Mechanics</strong><br>Light defines visibility. Enemies can only see illuminated areas. Hide in shadows, crouch behind cover, disable lights, or distract guards with sound and trickery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌑 Shadow Clone &amp; Blink Abilities</strong><br>Unlock powerful skills to navigate complex traps and outmaneuver enemies. Send your clone into danger or blink behind enemies before they even notice you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🗺️ Metroidvania Exploration</strong><br>Non-linear maps with ability-gated progression. Unlock shortcuts, discover hidden paths, and dive into secret challenge rooms filled with risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.poster.avif?t=1786505092\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.webm?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.mp4?t=1786505092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐺 Strategic Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses with distinct mechanics—some lurk in darkness, others summon illusions or use deadly traps. Each encounter is a battle of wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph